{"_id":"WmCraftRes000037","img":"icons/commodities/leather/scales-brown.webp","name":"Hatchling Black Dragon Scales (5)","sort":3700000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A <strong>Tier 1</strong>, <strong>Level 1</strong> dragon scales crafting resource: <strong>Hatchling</strong>.</p>\n<p>Its standard level-based crafting DC is <strong>15</strong>. The GM can apply PF2e's Easy, Hard, Very Easy/Hard, or Incredibly Easy/Hard adjustment when the crafting check is made.</p>\n<p>Each point of this item's inventory quantity represents 5 dragon scales. Its Black variety is retained for recipes that care about the resource's origin or damage type. Wrathmaker records the material, tier, and bundle size under module flags so future recipes can consume it reliably even if its displayed name is changed.</p>\n<p>This resource currently has no automatic sale price or recipe cost. The GM can award and store it now; category-based crafting requirements will be assigned separately.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","stackGroup":null,"traits":{"otherTags":["wrathmaker-resource","material-dragon-scale","material-tier-1","material-variant-black"],"rarity":"common","value":[]}},"type":"treasure","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"resource":{"schemaVersion":1,"materialId":"dragon-scale","tier":1,"unit":"dragon-scale","unitsPerItem":5,"variantId":"black"}}}}
